{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>DrawTrace 是一款相片描摹輔助工具，可把參考相片鎖定在螢幕上，讓你對照真實紙張親手描畫，適合藝術家、插畫師、學生，以及希望藉真實參考圖提升繪畫技巧的人。現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-147.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>四角定位鎖定參考圖</h2>\n<p>匯入相片或即時拍攝，拖動四個角對準紙張邊緣，再以雙指縮放、拖移調整位置。點按鎖定後，參考圖會固定在螢幕上，讓你可直接在真實紙張上描摹。以手動四角定位取代容易漂移的 AR 追蹤，毋須猜測對位；人物、風景、草圖與標誌等相片均可使用，並提供精確的四角透視匹配。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-168-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-169-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-170-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-171-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-172-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：DrawTrace</li><li>應用類別：Graphics &amp; Design</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/drawtrace/id6825751758?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.149528+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T05:58:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T21:40:55.597889+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:14:01.685799+00:00","content_hash":"b9c758fb13ce59ae2ff618e73df6dd03a1054d6012bbc538d6acbb77cb9a29a0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.149528+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}